      "text": "BBW:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " not for obesity or weight loss; ineffective for weight loss in euthyroid patients at usual doses. Oral thyroid hormone is not for myxedema coma."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
