    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Warfarin response increases (anticoagulant dose may need lowering; monitor coagulation tests). Digoxin effect may fall. In diabetes, glycemic control may worsen and insulin/antidiabetic needs rise; monitor glucose."
     }
